# error-value-unclosed-quote

## Input

```
a "value
b 1

```

## CST

```
SOURCE_FILE@0..13
  ENTRY@0..9
    WORD_KEY@0..1
      WORD@0..1 "a"
    SPACE@1..2 " "
    QUOTED_STRING@2..8
      DOUBLE_QUOTE@2..3 "\""
      STRING@3..8 "value"
    NEWLINE@8..9 "\n"
  ENTRY@9..13
    WORD_KEY@9..10
      WORD@9..10 "b"
    SPACE@10..11 " "
    INTEGER@11..12
      NUMERAL@11..12 "1"
    NEWLINE@12..13 "\n"
```

## Syntax Error

```
[
    SyntaxError {
        message: "missing closing quote",
        range: 2..8,
    },
]
```

## AST

```
SourceFile {
    items: [
        Entry {
            key: WordKey {
                word: WORD@0..1 "a",
            },
            value: QuotedString {
                open_quote: DOUBLE_QUOTE@2..3 "\"",
                string: STRING@3..8 "value",
                close_quote: none,
            },
        },
        Entry {
            key: WordKey {
                word: WORD@9..10 "b",
            },
            value: Integer {
                sign: none,
                numeral: NUMERAL@11..12 "1",
            },
        },
    ],
}
```

